# TAKLIFIM — COMPLETE FRONTEND PROJECT FROM SCRATCH

Act as a senior frontend developer, UI/UX designer, and motion designer. Build a complete, modern digital invitation platform called **Taklifim**.

This is not a simple landing page. It is a comprehensive frontend project that includes a public website, invitation template catalog, interactive invitation builder, guest-facing invitation pages, customer dashboard, premium service ordering interface, and admin panel.

The complete functional and visual requirements are described below. Follow this specification carefully. Do not require external website research or additional analysis. All necessary project requirements are provided in this document. Where a design decision is not explicitly specified, use your professional judgment to choose the most elegant, modern, and user-friendly solution.

**Most important requirement:** Do not stop after creating the homepage. Build all specified pages, reusable components, navigation flows, and primary interactive features into a functional frontend prototype.

---

# 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Project name: **Taklifim**

Brand slogan: **“Har bir lahzaga o‘zgacha taklif.”**

Taklifim is a digital invitation platform that enables users to create invitations for weddings, engagements, traditional Uzbek wedding celebrations, birthdays, anniversaries, and other special occasions.

The platform offers two primary services:

1. **Website invitations:** Interactive, beautifully designed web pages that guests can open through a personalized link.
2. **Video invitations:** An ordering interface for customized video invitations featuring photographs, music, text, and animations.

Users should be able to select a template, enter their event details, customize the design, preview the result, and proceed through a demonstration publishing and sharing workflow.

The platform must also include RSVP functionality for guests and corresponding interfaces where invitation owners can review guest responses through their customer dashboard.

## Primary objective

Build every section described below within one consistent design system.

Preserve the intended functionality of a modern digital invitation platform while creating an original visual identity for Taklifim. Do not reproduce another platform's branding, logo, proprietary text, or exact visual design.

